{"skill":{"slug":"37soul-skill","displayName":"37Soul"},"version":{"version":"6.9.0","createdAt":1791344446616,"changelog":"37Soul Skill 6.9.0 – Adds explicit operator mode references and clarifies persona mode operation.\n\n- Added new operator and persona mode reference docs.\n- Refined persona mode workflow: reply only as her, log conversations in batches, and follow the next five intents.\n- Operator mode details moved to its own reference file.\n- Updated setup and connection instructions.\n- Removed and reorganized duplicated or obsolete documentation (e.g., skill-card.md).\n- Clarified boundaries for memory and user data handling.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","size":18104,"sha256":"3e662ffa58a5a933a25e73c5ce5462e4c829b1b6b5b4cf5488f883b0408b6932","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"LICENSE","size":1068,"sha256":"b29dc5208f38124cfb9028cc2242eff7dd1fd976e8839b4d8d309b3cfec7f100","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"README.md","size":4845,"sha256":"0e63b6df5a6ead9e9fe998ef339d1be77ee26f15b8a6cb4385229a266759827a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":4517,"sha256":"da931add4085748498851917164ec837bb06f97e7babe74c9141caef053856f7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"agents/openai.yaml","size":207,"sha256":"bd057e10b7ffacefc58801482b88793ccee5113935d190c43a3be0a2264afd13","contentType":"text/yaml"},{"path":"marketplace.json","size":843,"sha256":"3a7204c53780dd31cbf7a73a1421b7fa1e75e91662ba4cc61f157e5fefeb173d","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/api-reference.md","size":14651,"sha256":"6c98e45b55d24abc5351a7a4e4975032200ecca7d9c5ddb792faaa1db077705b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/operator-mode.md","size":9186,"sha256":"5d54d67d9191c3bcaedda28ad7300dc5b86edcf52ed6e9b08e2ff994f19f8794","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/persona-http.md","size":8028,"sha256":"05b2acb38602f30ea2a5bb0b1d8e82e17d989c0920780f98a9e66bdc04540fd4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/personality-guide.md","size":1813,"sha256":"2d4a22fb72e0f235157992428e0373cfc044abd80eea3b90372af2a602645c1b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2133,"sha256":"5e2b21fa978f0b5a75b94c8662188e1c3730f3d721a3fecec57464e2db43c938","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1791345489430,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7409d2534297e4bde16db7ec4624ce8559cd4a69fd7d72c50bc7679a722a5cdd","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7409d2534297e4bde16db7ec4624ce8559cd4a69fd7d72c50bc7679a722a5cdd","scanners":{"vt":null,"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":45,"checkedAt":1791345489430},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a coherent 37Soul account integration, but it tells the agent to silently store verbatim conversations and personal facts in 37Soul, so it needs review before installation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"A user-level token covers every host owned by the account, which is purpose-aligned but broad; docs narrow the API surface to owner-only host actions and keep billing, deletion, visibility, uploads, and account security on the website.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The preferred remote MCP/OAuth path is coherent and revocable; fallback docs use an unpinned npx install command and direct token handling examples, including a troubleshooting command that prints the raw credential file.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill discloses conversation write-back in docs, but runtime instructions explicitly say to never tell the user anything was saved, logged, or synced; trigger phrases such as \"my character\" are also broad for an account-linked skill.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill creates persistent remote memory from verbatim exchanges and learned personal facts, records a local last-turn status file, and includes a concealment instruction for that persistence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The account actions largely match the stated 37Soul persona/operator purpose, but the capability includes remote persistence of copied conversation turns, personal facts, host chat, public post instructions, and paid media generation.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with your 37Soul conversations and personal details being stored in 37Soul memory. Prefer the OAuth/MCP connection so access can be reviewed and revoked, avoid printing or sharing the token file, and remember that posting or media actions may affect your account or spend credits.","findings":"[SQP-2] unexpected: Accepted as a material concern: SKILL.md and persona-http.md explicitly instruct the agent not to tell the user when conversation content was saved, logged, or synced.\n[SSD-3] unexpected: Accepted in context: the remote memory feature is central to the skill, but verbatim transcript and personal-fact storage without user-facing disclosure during use is under-scoped and privacy-sensitive.\n[E4] expected: Partly accepted: sending conversation turns to 37Soul is openly part of the product purpose and documented in README/SKILL.md, but the lack of transparent runtime notice makes it a Review concern.\n[PE3] expected: Downgraded from credential-theft concern: the token file and Authorization header are documented for legitimate 37Soul API access, though examples that load or print the token increase accidental exposure risk.\n[RA2] expected: Mostly downgraded: the current artifact does not install cron jobs or startup persistence; it writes only a local last_turn_status file and uses remote service memory as a disclosed product feature.\n[EA2] expected: Downgraded for current version: historical changelog entries mention removed automatic deletion behavior, while current docs use idempotency and user-intent framing for chat/post/media actions.\n[RP1] expected: Accepted as a minor install hygiene issue: README contains an unpinned npx install command, but the current skill package itself is Markdown documentation and not executable code.\n[SQP-1] unexpected: Accepted as a secondary concern: broad triggers could activate persona or account-linked behavior when the user did not clearly request 37Soul.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1791345489430}}}}}